# No sparkle icon

Never use a sparkle icon, sparkle glyph, or sparkle emoji anywhere in this codebase. That includes Lucide `Sparkles`, `WandSparkles`, and the ✨ character in UI, copy, comments, and commits.

For AI or copilot surfaces, use `Brain` from `lucide-react`.
